@SmartX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5015

### Register a sensor on Rack 1 (node-rack-1)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01",
  "locationNodeId": "node-rack-1",
  "category": "environmental"
}

### Ingest environmental float packet (device id is sx- + MAC without colons)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/environmental
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packet": {
    "deviceId": "sx-AABBCCDDEE01",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-14T17:00:00Z",
    "sequence": 1,
    "signalQuality": 82,
    "payload": { "value": 22.5, "metric": "temperature" }
  }
}

### Ingest power integer packet (register a powerConsumption device first — category must match)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/power
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packet": {
    "deviceId": "sx-AABBCCDDEE01",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-14T17:00:01Z",
    "sequence": 1,
    "payload": { "value": 350, "metric": "watts" }
  }
}

### Ingest actuator boolean packet (register an actuator device first — category must match)
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/actuator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packet": {
    "deviceId": "sx-AABBCCDDEE01",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-14T17:00:02Z",
    "sequence": 1,
    "payload": { "isActive": true, "kind": "valve" }
  }
}

### Fleet overview (Progressive Disclosure level 0)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/summary

### Filter fleet by zone (includes descendant nodes)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors?locationNodeId=zone-1&category=environmental

### Device details
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/sx-AABBCCDDEE01

### Device history
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/sx-AABBCCDDEE01/history?take=20

###
